# Set Basic credentials locally and rerun CSRF initialization before each mutation.
# See AUTHENTICATION.md for the browser login flow.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@employeeId = 1
@basicCredentials = REPLACE_WITH_BASE64_USERNAME_COLON_PASSWORD

### Initialize CSRF (REST Client must retain response cookies)
# @name csrf
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

### Current administrator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredentials}}

### Create (copy the returned numeric id into employeeId above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredentials}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ananya Sharma",
  "email": "ananya@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+91 98765 43210",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "designation": "Backend Engineer",
  "dateOfJoining": "2025-01-10",
  "salary": 1250000.25,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### List/search/filter/page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?search=ananya&department=Engineering&status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=10&sortBy=fullName&direction=asc
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredentials}}

### Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredentials}}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredentials}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ananya Sharma",
  "email": "ananya@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+91 98765 43210",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "designation": "Senior Backend Engineer",
  "dateOfJoining": "2025-01-10",
  "salary": 1500000.50,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/summary
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredentials}}

### Departments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/departments
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredentials}}

### CSV export (all matching rows)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/export?department=Engineering&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredentials}}

### Validation example (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredentials}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"","email":"invalid","phoneNumber":"abc","department":"","designation":"","dateOfJoining":null,"salary":-1,"status":"ACTIVE"}

### Delete permanently (run last, only on your test record)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredentials}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf.response.body.$.token}}

### API schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs
